OL,3,GNEWSAStudents 'devastated' as A-level
OL,4,Acourses cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents who learned their upcoming
OL,7,FA-level courses had been cancelled -
OL,8,Fon the day they collected their GCSE
OL,9,Fresults - have been described as
OL,10,F"devastated".
OL,12,FThe City of Liverpool College confirmed
OL,13,Fit was scrapping its A-level provision
OL,14,Ffor the 2026/27 academic year,
OL,15,Fimpacting an estimated 80 to 90
OL,16,Fstudents.
OL,18,FFrankie Tibbles, an English lecturer at
OL,19,Fthe college, said staff had been
OL,20,Finformed on Wednesday and described the
OL,21,Fdecision to tell students on GCSE
OL,22,Fresults day as "callous".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
