OL,3,GNEWSAStudents 'devastated' as A-level
OL,4,Acourses cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipal and chief executive of the
OL,7,Fcollege, Elaine Bowker, said running
OL,8,FA-level courses was no longer "viable"
OL,9,Fand said all students affected would be
OL,10,Fsupported to find alternative courses.
